"{{\"name\": \"Sunset\", \"base\": \"midnight\", \"colours\": {{\"wiiu\": \"#ff7a59\", \"ink-0\": \"#120806\"}}, \"corners\": 0.5, \"motif\": \"none\"}}\n"
"base: başlangıç teması (light, link-jack, classic, midnight, eden). colours: ink-0 ile ink-2 arası (arka plan), text, wiiu, n3ds, nds ve nx (her tarafınki), glass, line, good, warn, bad ve focus, #rrggbb olarak. corners: 0 köşeli ile 1.5 yuvarlak arası. motif: side, none veya eden."

#. {0} is Eden's data folder; {1} its game files folder (the same one unless another was chosen)
